<title>MEXICO: Maseca sets April 15 shareholder meeting.</title>
<headline>Maseca sets April 15 shareholder meeting.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican food company Grupo Industrial Maseca SA said on Monday it had called a shareholders meeting for April 15 in this northern industrial city.</p>
<p>Shareholders will not be called on to vote on any issues such as a dividend or capital increase, according to the agenda of the meeting published by Maseca in newspaper advertisements.</p>
<p>((-- Monterrey newsroom +528 3457617))</p>
</text>
